config DEFY_RP2040_FACTORY_HANDOFF
    bool "Defy RP2040 factory watchdog handoff"
    default y
    depends on SOC_RP2040 && FLASH_LOAD_OFFSET = 0x6100
    select SOC_RESET_HOOK
    select INIT_ARCH_HW_AT_BOOT
    help
      For an image that Dygma's RP2040 bootloader starts at 0x6100. The
      bootloader leaves its watchdog running, which the reset hook stops
      before Zephyr starts. With DEFY_FATAL_RECOVERY the hook also runs
      defy_fatal_recovery_boot(), which counts quick faults.
